"https://api.github.com/users/JaydenTeoh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaydenTeoh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaydenTeoh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaydenTeoh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":"resolved","draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/pulls/6672","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/6672","diff_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/6672.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/6672.patch","merged_at":"2023-11-07T21:49:01Z"},"body":"Pertaining to #6250 \r\n\r\nSummary of Changes made (as suggested by @easwars):\r\n- `transport/http2_client.go`: Disable Go's override of OS default TCP keepalive interval (currently 15s) on the client-side\r\n- Add documentation to retain OS defaults on server-side and example to implement it within `helloworld/greeter_server`\r\n\r\nI am still unable to replicate the bug mentioned originally in the issue and test whether my changes on client-side will fix it. \r\n\r\ngrpc version: v1.58.2\r\ngo version: go1.20.4 darwin/arm64\r\nOS: macOS Ventura 13.4\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1485\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/assets/90945854/0d8e0058-9a0e-43c1-8f6a-a42b859505a3\">\r\n\r\nat packet 3773, I applied the rule to `pftcl`:\r\n\r\n```\r\nblock drop in on lo0 proto tcp from any to any port = 8080\r\n```\r\n\r\nbut my server does not reset the connection after a single lost keepalive packet (I am using the default keepalive settings on both client and server side).\r\n\r\n\r\nRELEASE NOTES: none","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6672/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6672/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6250","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6250/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6250/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6250/events","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6250","id":1694133888,"node_id":"I_kwDOAacf885k-m6A","number":6250,"title":"TCP Connection reset after a single lost keepalive packet","user":{"login":"Lucaber","id":15067830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDY3ODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15067830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lucaber","html_url":"https://github.com/Lucaber","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lucaber/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lucaber/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lucaber/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lucaber/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lucaber/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lucaber/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lucaber/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lucaber/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lucaber/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":586671344,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODY2NzEzNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/labels/Type:%20Bug","name":"Type: Bug","color":"bfdadc","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[{"login":"easwars","id":1638487,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mzg0ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1638487?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars","html_url":"https://github.com/easwars","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":36,"created_at":"2023-05-03T13:58:57Z","updated_at":"2024-06-05T01:43:47Z","closed_at":"2023-12-07T22:04:58Z","assignee":{"login":"easwars","id":1638487,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mzg0ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1638487?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars","html_url":"https://github.com/easwars","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easwars/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":"resolved","sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### What version of gRPC are you using?\r\n1.54.0\r\n\r\n### What version of Go are you using (`go version`)?\r\ngo1.20.2 linux/amd64\r\n\r\n### What operating system (Linux, Windows, …) and version?\r\nLinux 6.2\r\n\r\n### Bug Report\r\n\r\nThe configuration of  `TCP_USER_TIMEOUT` to 20 seconds in #2307 and #5219 together with [go default tcp keepalive interval](https://github.com/golang/go/blob/0d347544cbca0f42b160424f6bc2458ebcc7b3fc/src/net/dial.go#LL17C1-L17C1) of just 15 seconds results in a tcp connection being reset after a single lost keepalive packet.\r\n\r\nLost packets of a tcp connection are normally being re-transmitted after a short amount of time, well within the 20 seconds timeout. But tcp keepalive packets are not being re-transmitted [(ACK segments that contain no data are not reliably transmitted by TCP)](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc1122#page-101). Therefore the timeout is reached after just a single lost packet.\r\n\r\nNormally not re-transmitting  tcp keepalive packets is fine as the connection is only reseted after `TCP_KEEPCNT`(default=9) lost keepalive packets.\r\n\r\n### Test\r\nTCPDump of a test grpc connection (disabled keepalives on the client to reduce packet count, the same issue can be reproduced with default keepalives on both the server and client):\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/15067830/235919538-e54c7789-2747-49dd-890a-b7ff8e72ed5f.png)\r\n\r\n- After packet 199 I dropped all traffic TO port 8090\r\n```\r\nsudo iptables -I INPUT -p tcp --dport 8090 -j DROP\r\n```\r\n- Packet 200 gets received by the client and answered in packet 201\r\n- Packet 201 is only visible in the tcpdump but does not get received by the server\r\n- Packet 202 resets the connection by the server when the next keepalive would have been send\r\n\r\nIncreasing the `TCP_USER_TIMEOUT` to 50 seconds results in the connection only being reset after 3 lost keepalive packets.\r\n\r\n```\r\n\t\tgrpc.KeepaliveParams(\r\n\t\t\tkeepalive.ServerParameters{\r\n\t\t\t\tTimeout: 50 * time.Second,\r\n\t\t\t},\r\n\t\t),\r\n```\r\nNote: Here \"keepalive\" refers to the grpc/http2 keepalive mechanism and timeout configuration, not the tcp keepalives.\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6250/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6250/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6670","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6670/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6670/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6670/events","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/6670","id":1919949147,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAacf885bkrwo","number":6670,"title":"crl provider: Static and FileWatcher provider implementations","user":{"login":"erm-g","id":110920239,"node_id":"U_kgDOBpyCLw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110920239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erm-g","html_url":"https://github.com/erm-g","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erm-g/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erm-g/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erm-g/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erm-g/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erm-g/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erm-g/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erm-g/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erm-g/events{/privacy}",